<article class="env-lemma" id="01IB">
  <p><a class="environment-identifier" href="/tag/01IB">Lemma <span data-tag="01IB">26.7.5</span>.</a> Let $(X, \mathcal{O}_ X) = (\mathop{\mathrm{Spec}}(R), \mathcal{O}_{\mathop{\mathrm{Spec}}(R)})$ be an affine scheme. The functors $M \mapsto \widetilde M$ and $\mathcal{F} \mapsto \Gamma (X, \mathcal{F})$ define quasi-inverse equivalences of categories </p>
  <div class="equation">
  \[  \xymatrix{ \mathit{QCoh}(\mathcal{O}_ X) \ar@<1ex>[r] &  \text{Mod}_ R \ar@<1ex>[l] }  \]
</div>
  <p> between the category of quasi-coherent $\mathcal{O}_ X$-modules and the category of $R$-modules. </p>
</article><article class="env-proof">
    <p>
      <strong>Proof.</strong>
      See Lemmas <a href="/tag/01I7" data-tag="01I7">26.7.1</a> and <a href="/tag/01IA" data-tag="01IA">26.7.4</a> above. 
      <span class="qed">$\square$</span>
    </p>
</article>